# GolfImprove (golf_training_app)

Dual-role Flutter app: **Golfer** records/analyzes swings; **Coach** reviews students. Title in `GetMaterialApp`: GolfImprove. Design size 393×852 (`flutter_screenutil`). Font Inter. Portrait only.

## Flow

Splash restores a saved session (`AuthController.restoreSession`) or opens onboarding (4) → role select (`UserRole.golfer|coach`) → Sign In.

- After auth: `AppRoutes.goToHomeForRole()` → `GolferNavbar` or `CoachNavbar`.
- Sign-up OTP then profile setup: golfer `ProfileSetUpScreen`, coach `CoachProfileSetUpScreen`.
- Guest: `continueAsGuest()` → `POST /auth/guest-session`. Login and OTP verify can merge that guest.
- Forgot/OTP/reset use `Navigator.push`, not GetX.
- Google and Apple buttons are still empty callbacks.

## Shells

- Golfer tabs: Home, Library, Record (fullscreen, hides bar), Progress, Profile.
- Coach tabs: DashBoard, Students, Reviews, Profile.

## State & HTTP

- Provider `AuthController` calls `AuthService` (real HTTP).
- Feature calls: `GolferService`, `CoachService`. Offline swings: `OfflineSwingQueue` then `POST /swing/sync/offline`.
- GetX for navbars and many feature controllers.
- Registered GetPages: splash, onboarding, role, sign-in, both navbars, home. Everything else is `MaterialPageRoute` / `Get.to`.
- `main` sets `DeviceHttpOverrides` (direct connect, DNS-over-HTTPS fallback).
- Base URL `https://golf.ssh.bd/api/v1`. Paths live in `lib/utils/api_constants.dart`.
- Root `*_DOCUMENTATION.md` files describe the backend, not Dart. Always skip `lib/views/dummy/`.
